  "summary": "Malicious code in verdaccio-tarball-local-storage (npm)",
  "details": "Verdaccio-tarball-local-storage is a combosquat of the legitimate @verdaccio/local-storage package. The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun and executes a 727KB obfuscated file (math_init.js) under it. The obfuscated bundle is unanalyzable and runs at install time via a downloaded binary, delivering an unknown payload. The package's published source code (dist/index.js) is a stub with all methods throwing \"not implemented\" errors — the real behaviour is in the obfuscated preinstall pipeline.",
